## Context

Reading-3 (tracker [[0605]]). One of the THREE global sweeps that run
FIRST (with [[0620]] terms and [[0615]] coverage-bar), before the region
edits. Extracted from [[0606]]-B so it can be raided as a standalone
sweep.

Canonical re-articulation of finding 22 (author, 2026-06-15): the main
text and the figure/table captions must be **standalone at the maths /
ideas level**, with `\ref` to the annexes for detail. **Only the annexes
may reference the code implementation** (file paths, function/module
names, config keys, filenames).

## Actions

1. Sweep `slides/manuscript/main.tex`:
   - **Captions** (figure + table): remove every `\texttt{…}`/`\fpath{…}`
     filename / code identifier; if the detail is load-bearing, move it to
     the relevant annex and `\ref` it. Keep content values that are not
     code (OSM tag `power=plant`, a Wikipedia revision id, quoted status
     vocabulary).
   - **Main-text body** (§1–§9 + Conclusion): same — no code references;
     relocate to annexes. (This overlaps 0591's §1–§9 code-ref work but
     extends the standard to captions, which 0591 exempted.)
   - **Annexes:** code references are allowed; do not strip them there.
2. Record the policy in `docs/editorial-brief.md` (supersedes 0591's
   caption exemption).

## Coordination

- The caption-REWRITE tickets ([[0611]], [[0616]], [[0617]], [[0623]],
  [[0625]], and 0606-A) already drop filenames in their new captions and
  are Blocked-by this sweep — they land policy-compliant. This sweep
  handles the captions those tickets do not replace.
- Run before region tickets (sweeps-first).

## Test

- Red first: `@pytest.mark.adherence` — no `\texttt`/`\fpath` filename in
  ANY figure/table caption of `main.tex`; no code identifier in §1–§9
  body (annex exempt). Class-regex guard, not per-instance pins.

## Verification

- [ ] No filenames/code refs in any caption or §1–§9 body; annex refs
      intact.
- [ ] Editorial-brief policy recorded (supersedes 0591 caption exemption).
- [ ] `make check` passes; manuscript builds.

## Exit criteria

- Text + captions standalone at the maths/ideas level; code only in
  annexes; `make check` green.
